1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:02,440
(Sheldon:)Of course.

2
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:05,380
(Sheldon:)He will hear it as an attempt
to mend fences,

3
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:07,750
(Sheldon:)as opposed
to the withering condemnation

4
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:09,520
(Sheldon:)you and I will know it to be.

5
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:12,040
(Penny:)Yeah. Yeah, that
was my plan.

6
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,290
(Sheldon:)All right.
Come on. Let's go.

7
00:00:13,290 --> 00:00:14,820
(Sheldon:)Oh, by the way,
thank you

8
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:16,690
(Sheldon:)for the delicious cocoa.

9
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:17,690
(Penny:)Oh, you're welcome.

10
00:00:17,690 --> 00:00:19,490
(Sheldon:)Boy, I'm getting
good at this.

11
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:25,170
(Leonard:)Okay, now that you're
back on the team,

12
00:00:25,170 --> 00:00:26,170
(Leonard:)let's get you caught up.

13
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:28,670
(Sheldon:)Before you begin,
let me say again

14
00:00:28,670 --> 00:00:31,740
(Sheldon:)how deeply sorry I am
for my earlier behavior

15
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:35,980
(Sheldon:)and how much I respect
and admire your leadership.

16
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:39,780
(Leonard:)Thank you.

17
00:00:43,890 --> 00:00:45,250
(Leonard:)So as you can see,

18
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:48,090
(Leonard:)not only can you store
your favorite equations,

19
00:00:48,090 --> 00:00:50,290
(Leonard:)but you can forward them
to your friends

20
00:00:50,290 --> 00:00:53,590
(Leonard:)or post them on Facebook
right from the app.

21
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:55,660
(Sheldon:)Well, I must say,
I am impressed.

22
00:00:55,660 --> 00:00:56,750
(Leonard:)Thanks.

23
00:00:56,750 --> 00:00:59,020
(Sheldon:)You all have clearly put
in a lot of hard work.

